      ro: ["Considerat 'Capitala Silicon Valley'", "Concentrație mare de companii de tehnologie", "Casa Misterelor Winchester", "Muzeul de Tehnologie al Inovației"],
      en: ["Considered the 'Capital of Silicon Valley'", "High concentration of tech companies", "Winchester Mystery House", "Tech Museum of Innovation"],
      es: ["Considerada la 'Capital de Silicon Valley'", "Alta concentración de empresas tecnológicas", "Winchester Mystery House", "Tech Museum of Innovation"],
      pt: ["Considerada a 'Capital de Silicon Valley'", "Alta concentração de empresas tecnológicas", "Winchester Mystery House", "Tech Museum of Innovation"],
