      en: ["Inner Harbor with shops and attractions", "National Aquarium", "Fort McHenry, birthplace of the national anthem", "Home of Edgar Allan Poe"],
      es: ["Inner Harbor con tiendas y atracciones", "Acuario Nacional", "Fort McHenry, lugar de nacimiento del himno nacional", "Hogar de Edgar Allan Poe"],
