      en: ["United States Naval Academy", "Largest concentration of 18th-century buildings in the U.S.", "Maryland State House", "Historic seaport"],
      es: ["Academia Naval de los Estados Unidos", "Mayor concentración de edificios del siglo XVIII en los EE. UU.", "Casa del Estado de Maryland", "Puerto histórico"],
