      de: ["Hauptstadt Floridas seit 1824.", "Heimat der Florida State University (gegründet 1851).", "Das Florida State Capitol ist 105 Meter hoch.", "Der Name bedeutet 'alte Felder' in der Muskogee-Sprache.", "Besitzt eines der stärksten Magnetlaboratorien der Welt.", "Liegt in einer hügeligen Region namens Red Hills.", "Entfernung zum Golf von Mexiko: ca. 40 Kilometer.", "Mission San Luis war im 17. Jh. das Zentrum von Spanisch-Florida."],
      hu: ["Florida fővárosa 1824 óta.", "Az állami egyetem (FSU) mellett itt van a FAMU is.", "A National High Magnetic Field Laboratory itt található.", "A város neve apalachee indián eredetű.", "Kilátóterasz található az új Capitolium 22. emeletén.", "Wakulla Springs a világ egyik legnagyobb édesvízi forrása.", "Kilenc hivatalosan kijelölt 'lombkorona út' (Canopy Road) van itt.", "Tallahassee az egyetlen floridai város, amely dombokra épült."],
      ro: ["Capitala Floridei a fost stabilită aici în 1824.", "Orașul găzduiește universitățile FSU și FAMU.", "Numele orașului provine de la tribul de indieni Creek.", "Altitudinea maximă este de aproximativ 62 de metri.", "Aici se află cel mai puternic laborator de magneți din lume.", "Cea mai scăzută temperatură înregistrată: -19°C (1899).", "Orașul are o populație de aproximativ 200.000 de locuitori.", "Zborurile către Tallahassee folosesc Aeroportul Internațional Tallahassee."],
      en: ["Capital of Florida since 1824.", "Home to Florida State University and Florida A&M University.", "The current Florida State Capitol was completed in 1977.", "Home to the National High Magnetic Field Laboratory (MagLab).", "The city's 'Canopy Roads' cover over 78 miles of terrain.", "Mission San Luis de Apalachee was a major Spanish mission (1656–1704).", "Tallahassee is located in Leon County, named after Juan Ponce de León.", "The city's elevation is approximately 203 feet above sea level."],
